<title>FINLAND: MUTUAL SUOMI OPERATING PROFIT UP 81 PCT.</title>
<headline>MUTUAL SUOMI OPERATING PROFIT UP 81 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to end-Dec, 1996</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit				   660 vs 364</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, taxes    75 vs 12</p>
<p> Investment income and charges	 gain 1,056 vs 675</p>
<p> Solvency capital				 4,026 vs 2,430</p>
<p> Solvency ratio (percent)			 131 vs 124</p>
<p> Net premium income			     2,955 vs 1,836</p>
<p> Operating costs				    218 vs 184</p>
<p> Claims paid					  873 vs 896</p>
<p> Other income and expenses		   gain 8 vs nil</p>
<p> Change in technical reserves	charge 2,268 vs 1,067 charge</p>
<p> Change in equalisation provision     charge 37 vs 25 charge</p>
<p> Policy holder reimbursement		    273 vs 269</p>
<p>Change in reimbursement provisions  charge 163 vs 58 charge</p>
<p> Exceptional items			 charge 112 vs nil</p>
<p> Extraordinary expenses		    charge 6 vs nil</p>
<p> Taxes						   16 vs 6</p>
<p> Minority interests			  charge 1 vs 2 gain</p>
<p> Net profit					    53 vs 39</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish mutual insurer is Keskinainen</p>
<p>Henkivakuutusyhtio Suomi. Company has cross-ownership with</p>
<p>insurer Pohjola which is planning to incorporate it.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0242</p>
</text>
